    "sourceQuestionNo": 6,
    "stemEn": "From the passage it becomes clear that (choose the correct option).\n\nNot one of the First Form girls would have anything to do with Erica because:",
    "optionsEn": [
     {
      "id": "A",
      "text": "She did not have any lessons with them"
